{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785993426951872001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"nasty-dunce-burrow","assignee":"","attestations":{"plan-review":{"algorithm":"HMAC-SHA256","author":"Iso Tester","head_sha":"fb56f84fc00c90b823f838a498a847fd1c7c6d15","key_id":"412fa5372ad877e0","kind":"plan-review","manifest":["plan-review: PASS","ticket: 35f1-c5af-ed5b-4db1","material: e10fb095ecc78fff","model: claude-sonnet-4-6","runner: pydantic_ai","blocking: 0","advisory: 5","regver: 83e5f63ad06d893a","verified-at-sha:fb56f84fc00c90b823f838a498a847fd1c7c6d15"],"signature":"edc75df918c12ba4a9aa910c4e5d4eab83f2e2990c67a3ba2255c277f0f47981","signed_at":1782766279619485000}},"author":"Iso Tester","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":11},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Iso Tester","body":"Plan-review PASS (signed @ fb56f84fc, model claude-sonnet-4-6). Advisory triage:\n- f8613b5c (REBAR= for probe, validity 1.0): VALID — will run the smoke test as 'REBAR=$(pipx environment --value PIPX_BIN_DIR)/rebar bash scripts/probe-rebar.sh' so the probe targets the PUBLISHED pipx build, not the editable .venv (matches docs/releasing.md step 5).\n- f67e162c (mcp-publisher login/org-membership ordering, validity 1.0): VALID — will confirm navapbc public org membership BEFORE 'mcp-publisher login github', and re-login if membership is publicized after.\n- f2b56a07 (P9 file-impact missing): FIXED via set-file-impact (pyproject.toml, server.json).\n- fe85bddea (mcp-publisher version pin, validity 0.57): noted; docs/releasing.md doesn't pin it today — out of scope for this release, candidate doc follow-up.\n- fe72c9a4 (positive rationale, validity 0.57, minor): rationale is in docs/releasing.md ('PyPI is the base; Homebrew and the MCP Registry reference it'; OIDC trusted publishing avoids stored tokens). Not re-stating on the ticket.","timestamp":1782766355481037001},{"author":"Iso Tester","body":"Version bump committed (ce9b836ef) + local build/twine check green. PR #92 opened against main with auto-merge (squash) enabled. Awaiting CI → merge, then will tag v0.6.0.","timestamp":1782766543034726001},{"author":"Iso Tester","body":"PR #92 auto-merge enabled; CI matrix running. mcp-publisher login confirmed fresh by operator (token.json refreshed). Homebrew formula reviewed — only url+sha256 need swapping to the 0.6.0 sdist. Waiting on CI → merge → tag.","timestamp":1782766600811854001},{"author":"Iso Tester","body":"PR #92 merged to main (810bd573). Tag v0.6.0 pushed → release.yml run 28402221564 in_progress (PyPI OIDC publish). Watching to completion.","timestamp":1782766716325578001},{"author":"Iso Tester","body":"SMOKE TEST (published 0.6.0): installed via 'pipx install nava-rebar[mcp]==0.6.0 --force' (rebar + rebar-mcp shims present). Probed the SHIPPED pipx binary (REBAR=pipx shim) against an explicitly 'rebar init'-ed isolated temp store (PROBE_LIVE=1 + REBAR_ROOT=tmp; store verified unchanged after).\n\nRESULT: 138 passed, 3 failed. All 3 failures are STALE PROBE-SCRIPT expectations, NOT 0.6.0 defects:\n  (1) line 146 'edit multi-field' uses 'edit --tags', which the engine intentionally removed (CLAUDE.md: --tags is not an edit field; use --set-tags/--add-tag/--remove-tag). Command errors by design.\n  (2) line 147 'edit priority persisted' is collateral of (1): --priority=3 rode on the same multi-field edit that failed on --tags, so priority stayed at its prior value.\n  (3) line 276 'show and list identical key sets': show returns comments+description (detail view); list omits them by design (summary view). Probe's identical-keyset assumption is wrong.\n\nConclusion: the published artifact installs and every real CLI command works. The 3 failures are pre-existing probe drift (predate 0.6.0). Filing as discovered follow-up.","timestamp":1782767101485871001}],"created_at":1782766051592473001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[],"description":"# Release nava-rebar 0.6.0 across all three distribution channels\n\n## What\nCut the 0.6.0 release (266 commits since v0.5.2; 73 feat / 57 fix / 19 refactor,\nincl. workflow engine, completion verifier, plan-review calibration) and update\nevery channel per `docs/releasing.md`.\n\n## Scope\n- Version bump in lockstep: `pyproject.toml` `version`, `server.json` top-level\n  `version` and `packages[0].version` -> `0.6.0` (one commit).\n- Tag `v0.6.0` -> `.github/workflows/release.yml` publishes to **PyPI** via OIDC.\n- **Homebrew tap** `navapbc/homebrew-rebar` `Formula/rebar.rb`: update `url` + `sha256`\n  to the new PyPI sdist.\n- **MCP Registry** `server.json` published via `mcp-publisher`.\n- Post-release smoke test: `pipx install 'nava-rebar[mcp]==0.6.0' --force` then\n  `scripts/probe-rebar.sh` against the shipped artifact.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `pyproject.toml` and `server.json` (both version fields) read `0.6.0`; local\n      `python -m build && twine check dist/*` passes.\n- [ ] `v0.6.0` tag pushed; `release.yml` run is green and PyPI shows 0.6.0 live.\n- [ ] Homebrew formula `url`/`sha256` point at the 0.6.0 sdist; `brew style` passes.\n- [ ] MCP Registry lists `io.github.navapbc/rebar` at 0.6.0.\n- [ ] `probe-rebar.sh` against the published build prints `PROBE RESULT: N passed, 0 failed`.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"pyproject.toml","reason":"bump version to 0.6.0"},{"path":"server.json","reason":"bump version + packages[0].version to 0.6.0"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"e76206c1-da6c-490f-95c1-ce2cd76d5cfa","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"35f1-c5af-ed5b-4db1","ticket_type":"task","title":"Release nava-rebar 0.6.0 (PyPI + Homebrew + MCP Registry)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["07558fde-4135-47d1-a453-01fc9f6feb7f","5ed4f6e8-1eed-4504-91c1-6591ff7496c2","357361cf-7832-4d3d-85dc-827e57c967a3","e76206c1-da6c-490f-95c1-ce2cd76d5cfa","df52a23f-ef19-43b1-bace-bf95059f31aa","fb3b2731-1f43-41aa-a5b9-9ce08c5da363","fc49db75-290b-45ae-a0e5-e4043904f839","636cd8b9-6d49-49d1-a54c-66bbde77b978","c6a90272-595d-4f19-9361-b73cf018da59","9e4b23b3-d6ab-4e0b-9b27-5a6c2cdfcaa5","f602356f-bac4-4d08-acd1-a7714f70611f","613e17a6-5809-4444-9b22-7bdbb53332ea"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785993426951872001,"uuid":"f2be352a-7c2b-4110-b219-a97db827f038"}